  "final_answer": "## Answer\n\nAccording to Wolfram Alpha, the blood relationship fraction between you and your father's mother's sister's son is:\n\n**1/32 = 3.125%**\n\n### Details from Wolfram Alpha:\n- **Relationship**: 隔代1表亲 (First cousin once removed)\n- **Number of generations apart**: 1\n- **Number of generations from common ancestor**: 3\n- **Blood relationship ratio (血缘关系比例)**: 1/32 = 3.125%\n\n### Reasoning:\nYour father's mother (paternal grandmother) and her sister share the same parents (your paternal great-grandparents). Going through both great-grandparents as common ancestors:\n- Path through each great-grandparent contributes (1/2)^6 = 1/64\n- Two common ancestors: 2 × (1/64) = 1/32",
